Establish an intermediate fact. Apply function extensionality and compare values at an arbitrary argument. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Establish an intermediate fact.

Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Use the resulting assumption. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Apply an available result and prove the equalities needed to match it to the conclusion. A detailed English derivation is pending.
